<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Diurganate Clergy -->
  <DD_IdeoRole_Clergy.label>双尾教牧师</DD_IdeoRole_Clergy.label>
  <!-- EN: The Clergy of Diurganate is a very important position in the church, which is not generally devoted to missionary duties, but to the maintenance of various equipment and mechanical artifacts in the Diurganate and to the conduct of a series of consecration ceremonies. -->
  <DD_IdeoRole_Clergy.description>圣双尾教的牧师在教会中是一个非常重要的职位，这个职位一般不专门负责传教，而是负责维护双尾神教中的各种装备和机械造物，并主持一系列的祝圣仪式。</DD_IdeoRole_Clergy.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Pre-battle Sermon -->
  <DD_Moralist_PrewarSpeech.label>战前布道</DD_Moralist_PrewarSpeech.label>
  <!-- EN: The Moralist of DivineDiurganate deliver a pre-battle sermon for the upcoming battle, and each participant will receive a divine blessing based on the quality of the speech, making them braver and more difficult to kill on the battlefield. The quality of the speech is related to the social attributes of the exorcist. -->
  <DD_Moralist_PrewarSpeech.description>对即将到来的大战进行战前布道，每位与会者将根据演讲的质量获得庇护，庇护将直接地增强与会者的战斗能力。演讲的质量和修道士的社交属性相关。</DD_Moralist_PrewarSpeech.description>
  
</LanguageData>